
| Feature                            | Azure Load Balancer              | Azure Application Gateway             |
| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| **OSI Layer**                      | Layer 4 (Transport)              | Layer 7 (Application)                 |
| **Protocols**                      | TCP, UDP                         | HTTP, HTTPS, WebSocket                |
| **Traffic Type**                   | Any TCP/UDP traffic              | Web traffic only                      |
| **Routing**                        | IP address and port              | URL, Host header, Cookies             |
| **SSL Termination**                | ❌ No                             | ✅ Yes                                 |
| **Web Application Firewall (WAF)** | ❌ No                             | ✅ Yes (WAF SKU)                       |
| **Session Affinity**               | ❌ No                             | ✅ Cookie-based                        |
| **Path-based Routing**             | ❌ No                             | ✅ Yes                                 |
| **Host-based Routing**             | ❌ No                             | ✅ Yes                                 |
| **URL Rewrite**                    | ❌ No                             | ✅ Yes                                 |
| **Health Probes**                  | Basic TCP/HTTP                   | Advanced HTTP/HTTPS                   |
| **Use Case**                       | VMs, databases, gaming, SSH, RDP | Web applications, APIs, microservices |


